      "date": "2026-05-24T02:45:44.000Z",
      "title": "GMM Pfaudler Limited Just Missed EPS By 48%: Here's What Analysts Think Will Happen Next",
      "body": "Shareholders might have noticed that GMM Pfaudler Limited ( NSE:GMMPFAUDLR ) filed its full-year result this time last...",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/in/capital-goods/nse-gmmpfaudlr/gmm-pfaudler-shares/news/gmm-pfaudler-limited-just-missed-eps-by-48-heres-what-analys",
