      "title": "GMM Pfaudler Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Financial Year 2025-26",
      "body": "GMM Pfaudler Limited announced that at the board meeting held on May 21, 2026, Recommended final dividend of INR 1/- per equity share having face value of INR 2/- each for the financial year 2025-26, subject to approval of Shareholders at the upcoming 63rd Annual General Meeting. Total dividend for financial year 2025-26 (including interim dividend) would be INR 2/- per equity share. The record date for payment of final dividend would be intimated in due course.",
